<p style="font:400 12px/1.5 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#6a7590;margin:0 0 10px;">Opened the month at 0.0% and closed at 11.9%. 0 of 31 activities are complete; 5 started during the month.</p>
<p style="font:400 12px/1.5 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#6a7590;margin:0 0 10px;">This month is still running — figures are to 2 Oct 2026; the month ends 31 Oct 2026.</p>
