  </table><p style="font:400 12px/1.5 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#6a7590;margin:0 0 10px;">The actual line starts on 2 Oct 2026, the first progress recorded on the platform; work before that is not on the curve. Programme finish: 30 Jul 2027.</p>
